## Normal Firewall (Layer3/4/5)

This firewall is used to secure applications and used by millions of people. 

Sees 2 communication services: 

- Request from laptop to server
- Response from Server to Laptop

Layer 3 and 4 packets and segments Request and Response are different and unrelated

Layer 5 (session) capability Request and Response can be considered as part of one session 

Reduces admin overhead and allows for more contextual security 

## Application (Layer 7) Firewall:

- Layer 7 Firewalls are aware of Layer 7 protocol e.g. HTTP
- L7 FW can identify normal and abnormal request. Protocol specific attacks
- Encryption (HTTPS) terminated (decrypted) on the L7 Firewall
- New Encrypted L7 Connection between Fw and backend
- Data at L7 can be inspected and blocked, replaced or tagged (adult, spam off topic)

L7 FW keeps all L3,4,5 features but can react to L7 elements (DNS, RATE, Content, Headers)
